{'symbol': 'HSY', 'date': '2021-12-14 12:17:00', 'title': "HERSHEY COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF DOT'S PRETZELS AND PRETZELS INC.", 'text': "HERSHEY, PA., DEC. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE HERSHEY COMPANY (NYSE: HSY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF DOT'S PRETZELS, THE OWNER OF DOT'S HOMESTYLE PRETZELS, AND PRETZELS INC., A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF PRETZELS IN THE UNITED STATES."}